title: "Prompt Optimizer"
abstract: "Seven prompt optimizers (APE, OPRO, MIPROv2, TextGrad, GEPA, PromptBreeder, bootstrapped few-shot) compared on local Qwen3.5 models on GSM8K and BIG-Bench Hard at equal budgets, with bootstrap intervals, cost accounting, a DSPy 3.4.1 head-to-head and transfer to a smaller model"
